      "severity": "must",
      "text": "Duplicate UNIQUE constraints get separate algorithms, so `CREATE TABLE t(a UNIQUE ON CONFLICT REPLACE, UNIQUE(a))` makes the model predict ABORT for a duplicate INSERT where SQLite performs REPLACE. Fix: merge equivalent constraints with SQLite's algorithm rules, or reject these schemas in the supported-subset check as a documented model restriction."
